                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cult classic port. It's the very same game I played years ago. Beside the addition of a VR mode that I can't test and a Steam workshop feature that I am not sure what it is for, nothing changed here; the same bugs remain here from the Vita port. This version could've benefited from many QoL features honestly, like widescreen or maybe proper stereo implementations. \nAside from all of this, Umihara Kawase is a cool platformer with cool rubberband physics, the inputs do exactly as I command. For the new commers, it's a hard to pick up and hard to master game. The tutorial are a good intro, and if you care about score attacking, there is a (as of now) cheaters-free leaderboard. The soundtrack is great and memorable. If you want a challenging platformer game, go for it. 10/10!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1789813948,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1789813948,
